  "description": "[![CI Pipeline](https://github.com/Mdsoare/artifact-analyzer/actions/workflows/ci-pipeline.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/Mdsoare/artifact-analyzer/actions/workflows/ci-pipeline.yml)\r [![Deploy to GitHub Pages](https://github.com/Mdsoare/artifact-analyzer/actions/workflows/deploy.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/Mdsoare/artifact-analyzer/actions/workflows/deploy.yml)\r [![Security Rating](https://img.shields.io/badge/Security-DevSecOps%20Hardened-green?style=flat&logo=github)](https://github.com/Mdsoare/artifact-analyzer/security/code-scanning)\r ![Security: CSP Compliant](https://img.shields.io/badge/Security-CSP--Compliant-success.svg)\r ![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue.svg)",
